        },
        {
          "text": "**Brown Dwarfs:** The fascinating \"failed stars\" that blur the line between a giant gas planet and a small star.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 97,
          "source": "topic-set-stellar-and-planetary-cosmology-from-birth-to-diversity-🆔20251031025753.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Stellar Populations:** The idea that stars come in different \"generations\" (Population I, II, and III) that tell the story of the universe's chemical enrichment over time.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 97,
          "source": "topic-set-stellar-and-planetary-cosmology-from-birth-to-diversity-🆔20251031025753.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Oort Cloud and Kuiper Belt:** The reservoirs of comets and icy bodies at the edge of our own solar system that hold clues to its formation.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 102,
          "source": "topic-set-stellar-and-planetary-cosmology-from-birth-to-diversity-🆔20251031025753.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Astrobiology:** The interdisciplinary field that moves beyond just finding habitable planets to speculate on the potential biochemistry of alien life.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 102,
          "source": "topic-set-stellar-and-planetary-cosmology-from-birth-to-diversity-🆔20251031025753.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Planetary Atmospheres:** The study of the \"air\" on other worlds and how telescopes like the James Webb Space Telescope are beginning to analyze them for signs of life (biosignatures).",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 113,
          "source": "topic-set-stellar-and-planetary-cosmology-from-birth-to-diversity-🆔20251031025753.md"
        }
